d": "ENG-1851", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_EMPLOYEE_0032", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1851", "number": 1851, "title": "Refactor System to Support Random Hero Token Quantities in Rotating Shop Containers", "description": "**Description:**\nThe current in-app system specifies a fixed number of hero tokens for rotating shop offers, as defined in Google Sheets. To enhance flexibility, we need to refactor the system to allow a random number of hero tokens, within a specified range (e.g., 5 to 10 tokens). This change would enable variability in daily token offers, such as offering 5 tokens one day, 7 tokens another day, etc.\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n* Refactor the current system to support a random integer range for hero tokens in rotating shop containers.\n* Ensure the range (e.g., 5-10 tokens) can be specified and adjusted through configuration.\n* Maintain compatibility with existing setups where a fixed token quantity is specified, so both random and specific token counts are supported as needed.\n\nThis adjustment will give greater control over shop offers and enhance the variety of rewards players receive in the rotating shop.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T19:14:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 408980, "labels": ["Shop", "Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-06T16:55:32Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T19:14:22Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1759", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-1865", "record": {"id": "ENG-1865", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_EMPLOYEE_0032", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1865", "number": 1865, "title": "Tile amount is not going down below 50 on redmi 9c. - it resets to 50", "description": "Version or date: android 374\n\n### Description: \n\nThe tile tokens for both minigames are not decreasing on a shitty android phone like redmi 9c - it always reset to 50 if it's below 50. So every time it resets itself to the cap if the token amount is not higher than 50. \n\nI am not sure what's causing that error that it doesn't happen on other android devices. \n\n### Visual References:\n\n[IMG_9972.MOV]([URL_51604])\n\n[IMG_9975.MOV]([URL_51603])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to normally decrease the token count\n\n### Steps to Repro:", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T19:15:02Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 408979, "labels": ["Nova Release", "Bug", "Sprint 26 Nova - Nov 22nd"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-07T18:14:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T19:15:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1761", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-1867", "record": {"id": "ENG-1867", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1867", "number": 1867, "title": "Endpoint to get players league scores", "description": null, "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-11-11T18:37:31Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-02T18:38:28Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 630776, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Nova Release", "Sprint 26 Nova - Nov 22nd"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-11T18:37:31Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-02T18:38:28Z"}}, {"file": "Ha