", "completed_at": "2025-04-29T16:55:24Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-10-30T03:03:01Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 417759, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-04-21T20:08:24Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-29T16:55:27Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2244", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2307", "record": {"id": "ENG-2307", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2303", "assignee_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "creator_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2307", "number": 2307, "title": "RPC to create and update teams", "description": "Include rules and logic for validations and additional team data", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-22T18:51:51Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-05T17:05:27Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-17T04:38:29Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 409109, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Teams", "Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-04-22T18:51:47Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-08T19:03:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2245", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2308", "record": {"id": "ENG-2308", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2303", "assignee_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "creator_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2308", "number": 2308, "title": "RPCs to join, leave and kick players from teams", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T17:05:47Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-17T04:38:30Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 409109, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Teams", "Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-04-23T19:01:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-08T19:03:18Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2246", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2309", "record": {"id": "ENG-2309", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2303", "assignee_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "creator_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2309", "number": 2309, "title": "RPC to get team info and its members", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-23T23:28:54Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-05T17:05:24Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-17T04:38:29Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 409109, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Teams", "Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-04-23T23:28:54Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-08T19:03:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2248", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2310", "record": {"id": "ENG-2310", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2303", "assignee_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "creator_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2310", "number": 2310, "title": "RPC to list and search teams", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T17:05:55Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-17T04:38:30Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 409108, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Teams", "Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-04-23T23:29:19Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-08T19:03:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2249", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2311", "record": {"id": "ENG-2311", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2311", "number": 2311, "title": "Push Notifications for Event Start Times (Server-Triggered)", "description": "**Background**\n\nWe want to improve engagement by sending push notifications when key in-game events go live. These notifications will be based on **server-provided event start times**, ensuring timely alerts for players regardless of time zone.\n\n---\n\n### **Goal**\n\nTrigger local push notifications when specific event types go live. Notifications must be scheduled using the **server-provided UTC** `start_time` and adjusted to the player\u2019s local time.\n\n---\n\n### **Supported Event Types**\n\nPush notifications should be implemented for the following:\n\n1. **Win & Collect**\n2. **Nathan\u2019s Treasure Hunt**\n3. **River Rush**\n4. **Streak Fever**\n5. **Axe Arena**\n6. **Daily/Monthly Login Calendar**\n7. **Season Pass**\n8. **Weekly Leaderboards**\n\nEach event type will be identified via a unique `event_id` or `event_type` string.\n\n---\n\n### **Requirements**\n\n* **Server-Side**:\n  * Provide `event_id`, `event_type`, `event_name`, and `start_time_utc` (ISO format)\n  * Include a flag `should_notify = true` to signal eligible events for push\n* **Client-Side**:\n  * On receiving upcoming event data with `should_notify = true`, schedule a local push notification for `start_time_utc`\n  * Adjust for the user\u2019s device time zone\n  * Notification payload:\n    * **Title:** e.g., \"\ud83d\udea8 \\[Event Name\\] Has Begun!\"\n    * **Body:** e.g., \"Your rewards are waiting! Jump into \\[Event Name\\] now.\"\n    * Deep link into the game (if applicable)\n  * For PNs see this spreadsheet: [[URL_52389])\n\n---\n\n### **Edge Cases**\n\n* Prevent scheduling duplicates for the same `event_id`\n* Reschedule notifications if:\n  * Player receives updated start time for the same event\n  * App is opened and the event is starting within 1 hour\n* Do not trigger notifications for past or already-started events\n\n---\n\n### **Analytics**\n\nTrack the following:\n\n* Notification scheduled (`event_id`, time)\n* Notification sent\n* Notification opened (tap-throughs)\n\n---\n\n### **Dependencies**\n\n* Server endpoint or config payload with event metadata\n* Push service integration (e.g., Firebase or iOS/Android native)\n* Notification permission checks\n\n---", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-06T17:01:41Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-22T16:23:54Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 384670, "labels": ["Hot Fix - Global Launch"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-24T02:36:24Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-22T16:23:54Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2259", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2320", "record": {"id": "ENG-2320", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2320", "number": 2320, "title": "Timer Issues", "description": "Version or date: 1722 android & 1500 ios\n\n### Description: \n\n* FTUE quest timer is not translated. \n\n  ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6205]-13_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_52424])\n* Out of pop up offer timers are placeholder. \n\n  ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6208]-91_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_52423])\n* Rotating shop time boosts shows 3h as the placeholder duration but it's only 15min.\n\n  [Record_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6207]_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.mp4]([URL_52422])\n* Axe Arena pop up needs better autoscaling \n\n  ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6206]-36_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_52421])\n* River rush timer is not translated both icon and event page\n\n  ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6205]-13_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_52420])\n* Streak fever event page timer should be readjusted.\n\n  ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6204]-12_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_52419])\n* In Streak Fever icon, it doesn't show timer. Instead, it shows \"Start\" text even though it's started. \n\n  ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6203]-66_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_52418])", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-29T02:58:22Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-05T08:30:13Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 409624, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-28T18:12:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T08:30:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2264", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2325", "record": {"id": "ENG-2325", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2325", "number": 2325, "title": "Implement Rival-Priority Tier Population System for Weekly League Reset", "description": "Revamp the current league tier population logic to prioritize real player matchups and healthy rivalry formation. Instead of each partition being filled with 1 real player and 19 bots, this system will fill top tiers with **real players grouped by rival priority**, and fall back to bots **only when necessary**. Each partition contains 20 participants.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83c\udfaf Objectives:**\n\n* Populate higher tiers with real players wherever possible\n* Group players who competed together in prior weeks to foster rivalry\n* Fill only unmatched slots with bots\n* Maintain a consistent partition size of 20\n* Ensure fairness in promotion and demotion flow\n\n---\n\n**\ud83d\udccb Requirements:**\n\n1. **Player Grouping by Tier:**\n   * At weekly reset, classify players into tiers based on performance (promotion, stay, demotion).\n   * Input: Ranked player list per tier.\n   * Output: Real player pool for each tier.\n2. **Rival-Priority Partitioning:**\n   * For each tier, group players into partitions (size = 20) by:\n     * Prioritizing those who were in the same partition last week.\n     * Preferring players with similar scores or activity levels.\n     * Avoiding identical groupings to keep it fresh week-to-week.\n3. **Fallback to Bots:**\n   * If a partition has fewer than 20 players:\n     * Fill remaining slots with pre-tuned bots.\n     * Match bot strength to the partition\u2019s average.\n4. **Rivalry Tracking:**\n   * Maintain a simple data structure per player:\n\n     ```\n     json\n     ```\n\n     CopyEdit\n\n     `{ \"player_id\": \"abc123\", \"last_partition_id\": \"2025_17_9_52\", \"rival_ids\": [\"def456\", \"ghi789\", \"jkl012\"] }`\n   * Use this for future matchmaking preference.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 410370, "labels": ["DD 2.1"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-04T20:04:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-27T14:14:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2272", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2332", "record": {"id": "ENG-2332", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2303", "assignee_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "creator_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2332", "number": 2332, "title": "RPC to send text messages and request lives from a team", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-05T17:06:38Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-07T17:19:29Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-17T04:38:30Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 406215, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Teams", "Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-05-05T17:06:38Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-07T17:19:29Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2273", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2333", "record": {"id": "ENG-2333", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2303", "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2333", "number": 2333, "title": "Add documentation for RPCs and important info for the client team", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-08T01:49:39Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-16T12:05:41Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-17T04:38:30Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 348929, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Teams", "Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-05-05T17:07:08Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-16T12:05:41Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2274", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2334", "record": {"id": "ENG-2334", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2303", "assignee_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "creator_id": "usr_PERSON_3138", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2334", "number": 2334, "title": "Team Leaderboards", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-16T12:05:41Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-17T04:38:30Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 348929, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Teams", "Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-05-05T17:07:46Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-16T12:05:41Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services