null, "identifier": "ENG-2342", "number": 2342, "title": "iphone 15 notch blocks level info and avatar frame.", "description": "Version or date: ios submission. \n\n### Description: \n\nThe iphone 15 notch creates invisible graphics and makes the game looks unpolished. \n\n### Visual References:\n\n![image.png]([URL_52500])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52499])\n\n* bottom HUD also had the safe area issues with the home button of ios. \n*", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-28T15:25:46Z", "completed_at": "2025-11-14T17:14:54Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 131179, "labels": ["DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-08T16:24:19Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-14T17:14:54Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2288", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2347", "record": {"id": "ENG-2347", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2346", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2347", "number": 2347, "title": "Addressable are not loaded, game stuck at splash screen", "description": "Version or date: android 1845\n\n### Description: \n\nWhile resolving language asset loading process, addressables are not downloaded currently which makes all the recent dev builds blocked. \n\n```\nCommandBuffer: temporary render texture  not found while executing  (SetRenderTarget color buffer)\nCommandBuffer: temporary render texture  not found while executing  (SetRenderTarget depth buffer)\n[<color=white>Unity</color>] Opening debug menu\n[<color=white>Unity</color>] No addressables manager.\n[<color=white>Unity</color>] No addressables manager.\n[<color=white>Unity</color>] No addressables manager.\n[<color=white>Unity</color>] No addressables manager.\n[<color=white>Unity</colo