.fatebreaker_bundle | Fatebreaker Bundle | 14.99 |\n\nNeed to add keys to iloc ([PERSON_NAME_0050]) for above ^\n\nIAP Payout List  and IAP Layouts tabs are updated already, please refresh: [[URL_52550])\n\nBundles are created and activated on Android - Bundles Ids are created on IOS - will be submitted once screenshots are ready.\n\n![image.png]([URL_52277])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-06-04T22:59:03Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-09T12:53:16Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-12-10T04:36:15Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 358961, "labels": ["Cookie"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-06-02T16:38:34Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-09T12:53:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2301", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2359", "record": {"id": "ENG-2359", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2359", "number": 2359, "title": "Animation before interstitial Ad", "description": "## **\u201cWe Don\u2019t Love Ads Either\u201d \u2013 Domino Delights**\n\n**Scene 1: Cozy Confession (0\u20132s)**\n**Visual:**\nSophie sits at a candle-lit wooden desk inside a cozy magical cottage. She\u2019s holding a scroll labeled \"ADS\", looking slightly embarrassed but warm-hearted.\n**Animation Direction:**\nSophie sighs softly, then smiles gently and looks at the viewer.\n**Voiceover (Sophie):**\n*\"We don\u2019t love ads either...\"*\n**Background Audio:** Soft ambient crackle or gentle harp pluck.\n\n---\n\n**Scene 2: Why It Matters (2\u20135s)**\n**Visual:**\nSophie opens the scroll on the desk, and a magical illusion projects above it: coins transform into glowing sparkles, then into happy players joining the Domino Delights world\u2014colorful, cheerful characters appear along a game path.\n**Animation Direction:**\nSparkles travel outward like fairy dust, transitioning to new player avatars appearing.\n**Voiceover (Sophie):**\n*\"But they help us welcome more players and grow our world!\"*\n\n---\n\n**Scene 3: A Little Help Goes Far (5\u20138s)**\n**Visual:**\nCut to Sophie next to a glowing potion bottle labeled \u201cNo Ads Potion \u2013 $5+ Supporters\u201d. A red \u201cinterruptive ad\u201d icon appears briefly, then vanishes in a puff of sparkles as Sophie gestures with her wand or hand.\n**Animation Direction:**\nLight magical effect (sparkle + poof) removes the ad icon. Sophie winks.\n**Voiceover (Sophie):**\n*\"Spend just $5 lifetime and\u2014poof! No more interruptive ads.\"*\n\n---\n\n**Scene 4: Thank You (8\u201310s)**\n**Visual:**\nFinal frame: Sophie waves warmly as magical sparkles swirl around her. A floating message reads:\n**Text on screen:**\n**\u201cThanks for helping us make magic \ud83e\ude84\u201d**\n**Animation Direction:**\nText floats in with sparkle effect. Sophie holds hand to heart.\n**Music Cue:**\nGentle chime or uplifting final harp note.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-12-03T21:58:33Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 103536, "labels": ["Pupusa"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-06-02T20:51:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-03T21:58:33Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2306", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2363", "record": {"id": "ENG-2363", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "In Progress", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2363", "number": 2363, "title": "After signing-in, the game stuck at splash screen-", "description": "Version or date:\n\n### Description: \n\nAfter signin