t_id": "ENG-2377", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2379", "number": 2379, "title": "Create MiniApp Bot in Telegram. Integrate DD", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-10-24T19:49:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 161264, "labels": ["DD 2.1"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:33:22Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-27T14:19:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2313", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-238", "record": {"id": "ENG-238", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-238", "number": 238, "title": "Implement Analytics Events", "description": "[[URL_49913])", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-08T15:39:57Z", "completed_at": "2023-10-16T17:39:10Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-04-17T00:45:54Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 1225555, "labels": ["Sprint 5 - October 13th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2023-10-02T18:01:21Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-16T17:39:10Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2329", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2394", "record": {"id": "ENG-2394", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2394", "number": 2394, "title": "Julius' gold tile conversion might crate phantom tile", "description": "Version or date: iOS_Submission_179, Dev_iOS_1751, Dev_Android_2040, Android_Submission_259\n\n### Description: \n\nWhen Juliu's 6-streak ability, the gold tile conversion is triggered, a one tile is targeted for the conversion. When players match the targeted tile just milliseconds before the conversion, they both happens. The card is matched but there is a visual gold tile in the board. \n\n### Visual References:\n\n[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6414]_1.MP4]([URL_52996])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to either retarget to another tile or remove the visual gold tile after the tile attached is matched. \n\n### Steps to Repro:\n\nA little bit hard to repro by playing\n\n1. Start a level with Julius \n2. Complete 6-streak\n3. Match the tile which the gold tile conversion targets\n4. Observe that the visually persistent.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-28T00:11:48Z", "completed_at": "2025-10-30T10:35:04Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 153179, "labels": ["DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-27T14:53:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-30T10:35:04Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2358", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-242", "record": {"id": "ENG-242", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-242", "number": 242, "title": "Implement Auth", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-04T16:58:55Z", "completed_at": "2023-10-23T17:37:40Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-04-24T00:55:05Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 1215477, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Sprint 6 - October 27th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2023-10-02T18:07:55Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-23T17:37:40Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2369", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-243", "record": {"id": "ENG-243", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-243", "number": 243, "title": "Implement analytics endpoint", "description": "'@Blake @Leonard to chime in.\n\nSomething about new end point for logging events.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-03-04T17:55:13Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1023939, "labels": ["Analytics"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-02T18:08:30Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-04T17:55:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2376", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-2436", "record": {"id": "ENG-2436", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2436", "number": 2436, "title": "New symbols creates visual bugs and non matchable in memory and river tile.", "description": "Version or date: Dev_iOS_1784\n\n### Description: \n\nAfter the addition of new symbol, both memory tile and river tile breaks. \n\n* The tiles with the symbol are not matchable\n* The symbol isn't visible\n* And it gives error every time it's clicked. \n\n[https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/ios:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/ba319a202a38faed3f829e306064e72c?time=24h&types=crash&versions=0.2.1786%20(1786)&sessionEventKey=e6cfb05501434cf28d8d6ff212774f87_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6421]](https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/ios:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/ba319a202a38faed3f829e306064e72c?time=24h&types=crash&versions=0.2.1786%20(1786)&sessionEventKey=e6cfb05501434cf28d8d6ff212774f87_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6421])\n\n### Visual References:\n\n[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6420]_1.MP4]([URL_53025])\n\n![IMG_5410.png]([URL_53024])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to blend them into symbol pool for both games and fix the visual & functional issues along with the error. \n\n### Steps to Repro\n\n1. Play memory or river tile\n2. Observer that they are broken", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-11-11T16:08:22Z", "completed_at": "2025-11-14T17:14:54Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 131179, "labels": ["DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:00:45Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-14T17:14:54Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2378", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-245", "record": {"id": "ENG-245", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-9", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-245", "number": 245, "title": "Add Sim Button", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-04T13:18:45Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-03T06:26:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112468, "labels": ["Sprint 5 - October 13th", "Puzzle Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-02T18:10:46Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-03T06:26:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2379", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-246", "record": {"id": "ENG-246", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-9", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-246", "number": 246, "title": "Instanced Prefab Issues", "description": "Modifying an instanced prefab modifies the original", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-04T01:26:46Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-03T06:26:18Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112468, "labels": ["Sprint 5 - October 13th", "Puzzle Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-02T18:12:27Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-03T06:26:18Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2380", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-248", "record": {"id": "ENG-248", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-9", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-248", "number": 248, "title": "Display Basic Generational Metrics for Each Level", "description": "See here:\n\n![image.png]([URL_49915])\n\nTwo tables:\n\n1st one list out the parent child relationship ratios\n\n2nd one list out the generation sizes.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-16T15:24:53Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-23T05:54:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1083700, "labels": ["Puzzle Editor", "Sprint 6 - October 27th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-04T01:22:31Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-23T05:54:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2382", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-25", "record": {"id": "ENG-25", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-3", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-25", "number": 25, "title": "Build - Dominos Conveyor Belt", "description": "* Isometric view of 4 columns of domino tiles flowing from top of screen to bottom of screen.\n* Game ends if any tile crosses a finish line near bottom end of the screen\n* Players start by selecting any visible tile as the starting piece, then they have to match pieces away from the constant stream of domino tiles that spawn. The matching mechanism is the same as the core game.\n* Domino tiles \u201cspawn\u201d by flowing into visible space from top of screen.\n* Each tile matched rewards 5 gold at the end to the player\n* The conveyor belt moves 3% faster per matched tile, this is additive 1 + 0.03 + 0.03\u2026.\n* No cost to play for now.\n* We can fine tune all sorts of variables once we test, this includes speed variables, gold reward, entry cost, etc.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2023-10-31T08:35:51Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1204498, "labels": ["Mini Game"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-03-22T19:49:16Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-31T08:35:51Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2385", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-252", "record": {"id": "ENG-252", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-252", "number": 252, "title": "Saga Map: bottom UI menu unclickable - iOS", "description": "The saga map UI menu buttons at the bottom of the screen are very difficult to click or unclickable. I can click them 1 out of 10 times.\n\n![IMG_3644.jpg]([URL_49918])", "priority": 1, "estimate": 1, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-09T17:57:50Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-03T06:27:43Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112467, "labels": ["Sprint 5 - October 13th", "Improvement", "Marketing"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-06T23:03:26Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-03T06:27:43Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2409", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-275", "record": {"id": "ENG-275", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-9", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-275", "number": 275, "title": "Puzzle Editor Tracking Avg Face-Up Tiles and Symbols", "description": "'@[PERSON_NAME_0054] said:\n\n> Puzzle Editor Tracking Avg Face-Up Tiles and Symbols\n\n> Sample output, 3 columns total.\n>\n> ![image.png]([URL_49930])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-18T12:37:23Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-23T05:54:20Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1083700, "labels": ["Puzzle Editor", "Sprint 6 - October 27th", "Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-09T22:28:26Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-23T05:54:20Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2412", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-279", "record": {"id": "ENG-279", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c557a2ae624e4fa1", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-279", "number": 279, "title": "at the victory screen, one needs to display both the coins won from finishing the level and lefto...", "description": "'@Leonard said:\n\n> at the victory screen, one needs to display both the coins won from finishing the level and leftover tiles. The total number then should be equal to your new total balance first on the victory screen (i.e. update coin balance top left corner) and then on the saga map. In this example, I got 660 coins from left over tiles and I started the level with the balance of 8010. After I finish the level my balance went up to 8970, meaning that I won another 600 coins from finishing the level\n\n![image.png]([URL_49938])\n\n![image.png]([URL_49937])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-18T01:47:26Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-03T06:27:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112467, "labels": ["Sprint 6 - October 27th", "Bug", "Friends & Family Build September"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-09T23:42:40Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-06T20:21:34Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2428", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-293", "record": {"id": "ENG-293", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-293", "number": 293, "title": "WebGL Gameplay UI Missing Some Elements:", "description": "'@[PERSON_NAME_0054] said:\n\n> WebGL Gameplay UI Missing Some Elements:\n\n![image.png]([URL_49956])\n\nTop right at the streak bar there is some background coming through the icons.\n\nBottom right the tile placement in hand isn't always correct, this includes:\n\nWhen game starts it's shoved at the corner\n\n![image.png]([URL_49955])\n\n![image.png]([URL_49954])\n\nHorizon piece also misplaced\n\n![image.png]([URL_49953])\n\nSingle piece needs to be moved slightly lower\n\n![image.png]([URL_49952])\n\nWe are missing a 2nd layer of the domino rack.\n\n![image.png]([URL_49951])\n\nThis one below is what it looked like in Figma\n\n![image.png]([URL_49950])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-30T18:06:30Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-03T06:27:19Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112467, "labels": ["Sprint 6 - October 27th", "Bug", "Main Game", "Friends & Family Build September"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-11T17:37:07Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-06T19:45:26Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2430", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-295", "record": {"id": "ENG-295", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-295", "number": 295, "title": "There is some artifact text on the bottom corner of the tab on IOS", "description": "'@Leonard said:\n\n> There is some artifact text on the bottom corner of the tab on IOS\n\n![IMG_3723.jpg]([URL_49958])", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2023-10-16T17:52:22Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1225542, "labels": ["Sprint 5 - October 13th", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-11T17:48:43Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-06T21:07:57Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2447", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-311", "record": {"id": "ENG-311", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-311", "number": 311, "title": "CI/CD Pipeline", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-01-03T06:59:16Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-07-04T01:32:26Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 1112435, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Sprint 6 - October 27th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2023-10-16T18:25:30Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-03T06:59:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2449", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-313", "record": {"id": "ENG-313", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-313", "number": 313, "title": "Bomb FF Fixes", "description": "debug button, streak rewards, both of them have the same bug where it just creates a dummy bomb tile with nothing on it, at center of the screen\n2:06\nOK, so if it IS different issue, then we keep the bomb tile for streak rewards, and in that case please:\nThere are 11 levels for friends and family build, let's put Nathan into level 8,9,10,11\nRest of the levels are Sophie (Level 1-7)", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-17T21:56:15Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-03T06:26:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112468, "labels": ["Friends & Family Build September"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-17T18:14:20Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-03T06:26:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2468", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-330", "record": {"id": "ENG-330", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-330", "number": 330, "title": "Puzzle Editor Wish List", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-10-23T18:16:14Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T15:37:26Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:45:51Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959277, "labels": ["Sprint 6 - October 27th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2023-10-23T18:07:27Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T15:37:26Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2499", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-360", "record": {"id": "ENG-360", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-10", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-360", "number": 360, "title": "Need to allow sequence to place tiles through depth priority as well as breadth priority and also random", "description": "![image.png]([URL_49969])\n\nWe currently have Type 1, need to introduce Type 2 and Type 3 (Random between Type 1 and 2)", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-01-26T17:07:46Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1078707, "labels": ["Puzzle Engine", "Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-27T21:52:34Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-26T17:07:46Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2500", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-361", "record": {"id": "ENG-361", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c557a2ae624e4fa1", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-361", "number": 361, "title": "Rewind causes strange bugs", "description": "It can easily create 2 situations if you rewind a bunch.\n\n1) A visual glitch where there is some strange extra tile visually in your hand.\n\n2) Child tile not revealed despite having no parents above them.\n\nBoth are seen in this screenshot:\n\n![image.png]([URL_49971])\n\nUpdate, discovered:\n\n3) Level doesn't end at all:\n\n![image.png]([URL_49970])\n\n4) You get tiles that you can match on the board that's face down, and they end up in your hand also face down, I matched 3-4 of these pieces, and I'm not sure what I was matching.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-11-06T17:23:55Z", "completed_at": "2024-01-23T05:53:11Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-07-24T01:49:26Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 1083701, "labels": ["Bug", "Main Game"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2023-10-27T22:03:12Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-23T05:53:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2509", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-37", "record": {"id": "ENG-37", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-37", "number": 37, "title": "Create Algorithm To Generate Puzzles", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-04-12T15:52:02Z", "completed_at": "2023-04-21T01:28:26Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-02-03T00:02:56Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 1482846, "labels": ["Puzzle Engine"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2023-04-03T15:35:37Z", "updated_at": "2023-08-02T00:06:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2519", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-38", "record": {"id": "ENG-38", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-10", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-38", "number": 38, "title": "Create Ability For Designer To Tweak Puzzle Generation Parameters", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-09-15T17:50:35Z", "completed_at": "2023-10-02T16:12:04Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1245802, "labels": ["Puzzle Engine", "Sprint 4 - September 29th"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "DES-12", "type": "blocks"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-04-03T15:36:20Z", "updated_at": "2023-10-02T16:12:04Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2522", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-382", "record": {"id": "ENG-382", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "EPI-10", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-382", "number": 382, "title": "New Roadblock Tiles", "description": "As discussed in slack, we're looking at 2 attributes that we can assign to tiles as we edit the layout.\n\n1) Terminator - these are manually inserted sequence stoppers that's layered on top of the level editor weights + stoppers are set.\n\n2) Disobedient Child - A tile that does not match any parent or parents above it (1 generation above).\n\n3) Disobedient Terminator - combination of 1 + 2 from above.\n\nThis is all for the sake of designing the dynamite tile levels. Goal is to force a player to break their routine for going for max streak matches to chase after a dynamite tile and actually have something to blow up using the tile and not having the dynamite tile being the last tile on the board/stack.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-01-03T07:00:25Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112434, "labels": ["Puzzle Engine", "Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-11-03T05:21:15Z", "updated_at": "2024-01-03T07:00:25Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2530", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-39", "record": {"id": "ENG-39", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-39", "number": 39, "title": "Create Perfect Play Bot To Test Puzzles", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-04-12T15:52:10Z", "completed_at": "2023-04-21T01:29:30Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1482845, "labels": ["Bot"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-04-03T15:36:38Z", "updated_at": "2023-09-28T00:22:43Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2547", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-406", "record": {"id": "ENG-406", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-406", "number": 406, "title": "Sophie character lingers bottom left corner after game ends", "description": "![image.png]([URL_49988])\n\n\"**Kage Bunshin no Jutsu\"**", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2023-11-16T16:02:49Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T15:35:27Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 959279, "labels": ["Bug", "Main Game"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-11-09T22:43:25Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T15:35:27Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2553", "field": "id", "value": "ENG-411", "record": {"id": "ENG-411", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_