"identifier": "ZOM-651", "number": 651, "title": "Move the deck the the bottom", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52973])\n\nPlease do the change shown above. In the core game scene, the matching deck that was previously below the minimap will now reside on top of the boosters.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165535, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:39:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T15:49:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3807", "field": "id", "value": "ZOM-661", "record": {"id": "ZOM-661", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-661", "number": 661, "title": "Add New Store Images For the Lite Iteration", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52980])\n\nWe'll need to store visuals changed in both stores. Before the submission, please renew the images on the store pages. The images can be found on Figma. \n\n[[URL_52979]) (TBC)", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165523, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:51:41Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T13:24:48Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3821", "field": "id", "value": "ZOM-69", "record": {"id": "ZOM-69", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-69", "number": 69, "title": "Bot system", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 426027, "labels": ["server-api"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T23:07:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-24T00:27:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3829", "field": "id", "value": "ZOM-77", "record": {"id": "ZOM-77", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-77", "number": 77, "title": "List of Compatibility Issues based on Tablet Size", "description": "on iPad for example, the battlefield portion is way too small compared to everything else.\n\nConsider taking spaces from other UI elements. Or reduce sizing of something, game board, booster bar, match bar, etc. \n\n* Home screen image is not optimized for ipad resolution.\n  * That's why the positions of event icons and setting button looks off. \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_52403])\n* Plague Race \n  * Searching for opponents overlay is not fully stretched. \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_52402])\n  * Infographic overlay is not fully stretched. \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_52401])\n  * The event screen is above homepage and it's visible from the bottom navigation bar and the home page image shown in the sides. \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_52400])\n* In Leaderboard, \n  * The top UI is not fully stretched. Empty parts in sides are not scrollable. \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_52399])\n* Sides are not scrollable in item section as well \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_52398])\n* Core game object are is too small and looks unnatural and bad UX. \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_52397])\n* Profile page header is not stretched \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_52396])\n* Tutorials \n  * Lvl 2 Boss highlight is not scaled. \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_52395])", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-07-12T00:15:42Z", "completed_at": "2025-07-28T18:28:47Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 288065, "labels": ["Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-25T17:02:41Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-28T18:28:47Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3835", "field": "id", "value": "ZOM-83", "record": {"id": "ZOM-83", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-82", "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-83", "number": 83, "title": "Event Icon", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52432])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52431])\n\nThe event icon is a torn up flag. We will need template art for different icon states along this first icon to serve as a template.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-05T16:20:39Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-13T01:18:52Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353895, "labels": ["Live Ops and Monetization", "2D Art"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-29T14:47:51Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T01:18:52Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3836", "field": "id", "value": "ZOM-84", "record": {"id": "ZOM-84", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-82", "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-84", "number": 84, "title": "Tutorial Infographic", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52433])\n\nWe need to choose a tutorial infographic style that will be used throughout the game and make one for Plague Race.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-06T15:06:02Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-17T16:34:23Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 347220, "labels": ["Live Ops and Monetization", "2D Art"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-29T14:49:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-17T16:34:23Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3837", "field": "id", "value": "ZOM-85", "record": {"id": "ZOM-85", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-82", "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-85", "number": 85, "title": "Intro Pop Up", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52434])\n\nThe pop up that will be shown at event start.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-06T15:06:19Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-13T01:19:01Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353895, "labels": ["Live Ops and Monetization", "2D Art"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-29T14:50:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T01:19:01Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3838", "field": "id", "value": "ZOM-86", "record": {"id": "ZOM-86", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-82", "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-86", "number": 86, "title": "Fail Screen", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52435])\n\nTo be shown at the end of the event. To be updated by @[PERSON_NAME_0019] if consolation price is design approved.", "priority": 2, "esti